I'm not sure if this has been done before... Several of us have recently purchased Sherbinski seeds and I thought it would be fun to run a group journal. Not competitive, just to have some fun. Feel free to comment and critique and share your sherbinski grows. 

 @curious2garden @shnkrmn @Tvanmunhen 

I have two Sherbinski Acai Jelly and four Polar Gelato going. One did not pop unfortunately and when I dug the seed out it hadn't even cracked. Bummer but I have four. I also have the freebie gelato from Expert Seeds and one of @BobBitchen 's Chernobyl

